{"speciesId":503,"names":{"fr":"Clamiral","es":"Samurott","en":"Samurott","ja":"ダイケンキ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il peut terrasser ses ennemis d’un coup de la lame enchâssée dans son armure, et les faire taire d’un seul regard."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les pièces d’armure sur ses pattes antérieures sont de grandes lames. Un simple cri peut intimider son ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Part of the armor on its anterior legs becomes a giant sword. Its cry alone is enough to intimidate most enemies."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"In the time it takes a foe to blink, it can draw and sheathe the seamitars attached to its front legs."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"In the time it takes a foe to blink, it can draw and sheathe the seamitars attached to its front legs."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il dissimule de grandes lames qu’il dégaine en un éclair des fourreaux de ses pattes antérieures."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"En un abrir y cerrar de ojos, puede desenvainar y envainar los sables que hay en sus patas delanteras."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"In the time it takes a foe to blink, it can draw and sheathe the seamitars attached to its front legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"敵が 瞬きする あいだに 前足に ついた アシガタナで 相手を 切りつけ 元に戻せる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut terrasser ses ennemis d’un coup de la lame enchâssée dans son armure, et les faire taire d’un seul regard."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Derriba a su rival con un solo tajo del sable que lleva en su coraza. Acalla al enemigo con una simple mirada."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one o